{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPACE HOLE is a bite sized arcade game where you grow a tail of energy and deposit it into the SPACE HOLE while avoiding enemies and obstacles. Dunking large amounts of energy into the SPACE HOLE will net you a point multiplier, but the more points you have will bring about more challenge -- so act fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This simple game expects no more than a minute or two of the player's time for a round. Try to beat your high score and earn bragging rights by topping the Steam Leaderboards, while enjoying a reactive music track from James Bennett.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a Mouse, a keyboard, or (preferably) a gamepad for this classic two button arcade game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822870/be4d1d34f3ea1a0e537420c4a661545344e3192a.jpg"},{"name":"Tortoise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822870/76857f876f7f9df984c76ac98d800454712f7e58.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822870/bba20dda31274e57fe7ad71874df7d13f84a5630.jpg"},{"name":"Shark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822870/9a154fe26713dd2ed6c9057aac8f3913f67d1791.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822870/e0202f975c7466b00de424b1525265054b3401de.jpg"},{"name":"Fat Stacks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822870/f2dde7516e0d2175e180cd38df5b1c2bcabc2d7d.jpg"},{"name":"Bait","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3822870/42f36f71ff2f62d35a631a7cf9aba84360d52f02.jpg"},{"name":"Full Stack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/382